    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29491" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">†
		mŏlŏchĭna</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		moloche, = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοχίνη</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a garment woven
				of fibres from the mallow</i>: carbasina molochina ampelina,
			Caecil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 548, 14</span></i> (Com. Rel. v.
			139 Rib.).—Also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlucĭum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moli-cina</span></b> , Nov. ap. <i><span class="en">Non.
				539, 20</span></i> (Com. Rel. v. 71 Rib.).</div>
